# Rootfs build artifacts — gitignored in the repo AND excluded from the docker
# context. The Dockerfile's `ADD ${ROOTFS_TAR} /` can therefore only reference a
# tarball the builder explicitly produced. CI writes out/<arch>.tar.gz and passes
# ROOTFS_TAR=out/<arch>.tar.gz (build.yml); the README shows the same local flow.
# A bare `docker build .` (default ROOTFS_TAR=rootfs-x86_64.tar.gz) fails loudly
# at ADD instead of silently baking a stale or wrong-arch rootfs.
rootfs-*.tar.gz
rootfs-*.img
*.sha256
logs/
tmp/